<title>USA: New York physical copper market - Apr 7.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - Apr 7.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for April shipment were quoted at a nominal 109.25 to 109.50 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 87.00 cents, down 4.00 cents from April 4th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
